<title>IRAN: Iran to begin Ramadan fasting month on Saturday.</title>
<headline>Iran to begin Ramadan fasting month on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran will start the Moslem holy fasting month of Ramadan on Saturday, state-run Tehran radio said on Friday.</p>
<p>Most other countries in the Moslem world marked on Friday the beginning of Ramadan.</p>
</text>
